{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7b5599c4-f5ed-87f1-bbdf-e7372f3b5889",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T10:30:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. My name is Dominic Conti, I'm calling about a storm drain, a catch basin really, in front of 147 Kay Street, up on the Hill. It's been holding water since last Thursday. Well, Wednesday night into Thursday, I should be exact, because that's when I first noticed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Conti. And has it been raining, or is this just standing water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the thing, it hasn't rained. We haven't had a real rain in days. It's dry out. The basin is packed with sand, all that stuff they put down on the road this winter, and it's just sitting there. The water has nowhere to go, so the street holds a big puddle, and now it's got a skin of ice on it in the mornings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:27:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the sand and salt mix will do that. It washes right into the grates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:27:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I've lived here, um, a little over two years, and my neighbor, the woman next door, says it happens every big rain. Every single one. So this is not new, and it's not getting fixed, which, honestly, I'm tired of walking around it to get to my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me see what I can pull up on that location. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:28:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm looking at the drain maintenance list. Kay Street, you said 147?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 147 Kay Street. The basin is right at the curb, just below the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:28:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask you something? Do you know when they last came by to clean it out? I'd like to know if it's been a month or a year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:28:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can see a note on the street, but I can't tell you for sure it's that exact basin. I can put in a request and have the crew supervisor check the cleaning record for it. Would you want me to also have someone call you back with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you want me to call back. Fine, I can do that, but who do I ask for, and what time? Because I'd rather not get bounced around again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, you don't have to call back. I said we'd call you. I'd take your number and someone from here would reach out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I'm sorry, I misheard you, the line cut a little on my end. Yes, please, that's better. My number is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0185. And that's Conti, C-O-N-T-I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Dominic, with a C at the, no, with a D at the start, sorry, D-O-M-I-N-I-C."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'm writing this up as a clogged catch basin at 147 Kay Street, sand buildup, standing water since last Thursday, dry weather, and icing in the mornings. I'll flag the icing so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:29:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And I'd like it noted that the neighbor says this is a recurring thing, every big rain. If it's already on a list somewhere, it clearly isn't getting done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add that in the notes. Crews do the basins in rounds this time of year, usually once the sweepers start up, but I'll ask that this one gets pulled out of the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. When would you say I might hear something? Today, this week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd expect a call within a couple of working days, and the cleaning itself, I'd say sometime this week or early next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's a window I can work with. Thank you, Denise. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Conti. Take care of that ice out there."
    }
  ],
